{
  "id": "6a8c1a68f4ece9fcff0d92a1",
  "title": "井戸端米部",
  "created": 1787566822,
  "updated": 1787741069,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8c1a68f4ece9fcff0d92a1",
      "text": "井戸端米部",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566822,
      "updated": 1787566822
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1ae60000000000d10f90",
      "text": "　お米の情報を交換しよう！[joniel.icon]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566822,
      "updated": 1787566836
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1ae60000000000d10f91",
      "text": "　　毎日食べるから美味しい方がうれしいため",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566823,
      "updated": 1787567838
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1af40000000000d10f92",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566837,
      "updated": 1787566837
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2bc200000000000d69dc",
      "text": "品種",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636674,
      "updated": 1787636676
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cc4a700000000003fb923",
      "text": " [農林1号]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787610279,
      "updated": 1787741069
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c20ac0000000000eaad08",
      "text": " [コシヒカリ]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787568301,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c20e90000000000eaad09",
      "text": "  [コシヒカリBL]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787568361,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0d99000000000089da25",
      "text": " [ササニシキ]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787628954,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0dad000000000089da26",
      "text": " [あきたこまち]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787628973,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0de5000000000089da27",
      "text": " [きらら397]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787629030,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b020000000000d10f93",
      "text": " [五百川]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787566851,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b0f0000000000d10f95",
      "text": " [青天の霹靂]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787566864,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b2d0000000000c0c9ad",
      "text": " [いちほまれ]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787566894,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b380000000000c0c9ae",
      "text": " [華越前]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787566905,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1c130000000000920efb",
      "text": " [はえぬき]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787567125,
      "updated": 1787636685
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d09d20000000000590f36",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787627986,
      "updated": 1787627986
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d09d20000000000590f37",
      "text": "米の品種 中学受験で覚えた",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787627986,
      "updated": 1787628001
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d09e10000000000590f38",
      "text": " 土地ごとの名産品的な",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787628002,
      "updated": 1787628008
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33db0000000000cd3677",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573211,
      "updated": 1787573211
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5900000000003f4320",
      "text": "[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567450,
      "updated": 1787567450
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1c140000000000920efc",
      "text": "\tコメ何かえば いいのか全然わからん…1年くらい前いつも買ってた雑穀入のやつがスーパーからなくなってて途方に暮れて　手ぶらで帰った",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567125,
      "updated": 1787567449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1de20000000000920efe",
      "text": "\t 買うサイクルが長めで新米がうますぎるので普段食べるお米を選ぶのが難しい...[joniel.icon]",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787567587,
      "updated": 1787567644
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5800000000003f431d",
      "text": " [令和の米騒動]、とかやってたのもう1年以上前か",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787567449,
      "updated": 1787568733
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1d5800000000003f431e",
      "text": "\t家でお米食べる習慣なくなってるな",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787567449,
      "updated": 1787567449
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c1b070000000000d10f94",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6a257912c40c8afba490c3cc",
      "created": 1787566855,
      "updated": 1787566855
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33f80000000000cd3679",
      "text": "[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573240,
      "updated": 1787573242
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33fa0000000000cd367b",
      "text": " メイドさんが育てたお米を買ったことがある",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573243,
      "updated": 1787573258
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c34910000000000cd367c",
      "text": "  はえぬきだった",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573393,
      "updated": 1787573398
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cef51000000000071a97e",
      "text": " 炊飯器のスペックも関わってくるから変数が多い",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787621202,
      "updated": 1787621224
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6e1e00000000001512ee",
      "text": " ついでに[Pomate.icon]にスレを立てた",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787653663,
      "updated": 1787653687
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6e3700000000001512f0",
      "text": "  [お米総合 https://pomate.cc/clusters/food/topic/s1lw5zqjto6g9dr3fz3u8kf9]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787653688,
      "updated": 1787653700
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8dad71000000000063cb00",
      "text": "   [油で米を炊く]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787669874,
      "updated": 1787669882
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8dae460000000000524c8d",
      "text": "   [八代目儀兵衛の米の炊き方]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787670086,
      "updated": 1787670129
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8c33fa0000000000cd367a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787573242,
      "updated": 1787573242
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cd09d00000000003f1a6d",
      "text": "[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787613342,
      "updated": 1787613343
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cd09f00000000003f1a6f",
      "text": "\t地元の農家さんから購入で品種よく知らぬ",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787613343,
      "updated": 1787613356
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cd0ac00000000003f1a70",
      "text": "\t玄米状態で購入、胚芽とか残す程度の五分搗きくらいまで精米してから炊いてる",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787613356,
      "updated": 1787613521
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cd15600000000003f1a71",
      "text": "\tこの状態に慣れたために、たまに白米で食べると甘いナニかという認識、なんか米っぽくないという感覚に",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787613526,
      "updated": 1787613570
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8cd09e00000000003f1a6e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1787613343,
      "updated": 1787613343
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce3220000000000add9b0",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787618083,
      "updated": 1787618084
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce3230000000000add9b2",
      "text": "\t逆に有名どころの米って違いがわからん",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787618084,
      "updated": 1787618112
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce3400000000000add9b3",
      "text": "\t\t全部同じように美味い",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787618112,
      "updated": 1787618121
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce34f0000000000add9b4",
      "text": "\t食べ比べたことがないからか",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787618127,
      "updated": 1787618135
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce3230000000000add9b1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787618084,
      "updated": 1787618084
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce44a0000000000ade3e6",
      "text": "[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1787618378,
      "updated": 1787618378
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce44a0000000000ade3e8",
      "text": " 米という情報を食ってるので[マンナンひかり]を混ぜても美味しくいただける",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787618379,
      "updated": 1787621241
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce4590000000000ade3ea",
      "text": " それでも脱穀したての米は美味しいのだと思う",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1787618393,
      "updated": 1787618408
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8ce44a0000000000ade3e7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1787618378,
      "updated": 1787618378
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d13db0000000000c36af4",
      "text": "[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787630555,
      "updated": 1787630556
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d13dc0000000000c36af5",
      "text": " その時安かったやつを買う",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787630557,
      "updated": 1787630563
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d13e30000000000c36af6",
      "text": "  今は[サキホコレ]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787630563,
      "updated": 1787630572
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d13da0000000000c36af3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1787630554,
      "updated": 1787630554
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d22e60000000000695bcd",
      "text": "[vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787634409,
      "updated": 1787634409
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d22e70000000000695bcf",
      "text": " 値段の安さで選んでいて味をみてなかった。銘柄によって味が違う？のをわかりたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787634409,
      "updated": 1787634667
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d232a0000000000695bd1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1787634475,
      "updated": 1787634475
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2b5000000000000d69d5",
      "text": "米の違いが",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636560,
      "updated": 1787643072
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2b8400000000000d69d9",
      "text": " わかる",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636613,
      "updated": 1787636615
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2b8600000000000d69da",
      "text": " わからない[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636615,
      "updated": 1787636620
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2b8c00000000000d69db",
      "text": "  回転寿司店のシャリの味の違いならわかる[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636621,
      "updated": 1787636658
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d44c800000000000b7d6a",
      "text": "   これは酢とかの違いだろう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787643081,
      "updated": 1787643090
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d64900000000000ea1c86",
      "text": " 微妙。場合によっては違いを感じることもある[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787651217,
      "updated": 1787651244
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d64950000000000ea1c87",
      "text": " 　昔、一番安い米を買ったら、入念に何度も磨がないと臭くて食べられたものではなかった",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787651223,
      "updated": 1787653881
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d65d30000000000ea1c8b",
      "text": " 　　もう袋を空けた瞬間から強い臭いがするのよ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787651541,
      "updated": 1787651998
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d666d0000000000ea1c8c",
      "text": " 　いつもの米を変えた時に、直後には違いを感じることもあるが、相対的かつ微妙な違いとして知覚しているので前の米の味を忘れるのと同時に失認する。これは違いが分かるというより「慣れ」の問題",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787651695,
      "updated": 1787653927
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d2b5100000000000d69d6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787636562,
      "updated": 1787636562
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d412700000000006cee8b",
      "text": "モソモソしたり食感系に差がよく出るんじゃないかと踏んでいる[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1787642155,
      "updated": 1787642204
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d644f0000000000ea1c82",
      "text": "　惣菜屋やコンビニの弁当のお米は冷めても美味しい[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787651152,
      "updated": 1787651335
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6b2d0000000000ec3974",
      "text": "　 たしかに。冷めても美味しい米というのはいい着眼点かもしれない[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1787652910,
      "updated": 1787652930
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d698a0000000000ea1c8d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652491,
      "updated": 1787652492
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6ab90000000000ea1c9a",
      "text": "[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652794,
      "updated": 1787652794
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6abd0000000000ea1c9b",
      "text": "違いに気づく時",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652798,
      "updated": 1787652928
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6ad60000000000ea1c9d",
      "text": "　外食をすると自分が適当な炊飯器で炊いたのより美味しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652824,
      "updated": 1787652852
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6a560000000000ea1c96",
      "text": "　　大抵の料理店はコシヒカリ等のお高めの銘柄をミネラルウォーターで炊いている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652695,
      "updated": 1787652911
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6a560000000000ea1c97",
      "text": "　自宅の炊飯器よりも[飯盒炊爨]で炊いたご飯のほうが美味しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652695,
      "updated": 1787653035
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6a560000000000ea1c98",
      "text": "　新米のほうが美味しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652695,
      "updated": 1787652785
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d6a770000000000ea1c99",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1787652728,
      "updated": 1787652729
    }
  ]
}